      <span class="hero-eyebrow">Module 6 · Lesson 5</span>
      <h1>Preventing <span class="accent">Overfitting</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Master regularization techniques to build models that generalize well to unseen data, from early stopping to dropout and ensemble methods.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Learning Objectives -->
    <div class="objectives">
      <h4>Learning Objectives</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand the bias-variance tradeoff</li>
        <li>Implement L1 and L2 regularization</li>
