      <h2>Exercises</h2>

      <h3>Exercise 1: L1 vs L2 Comparison</h3>
      <p>Train Ridge and Lasso models with varying regularization strengths. Compare how regularization strength affects coefficients and test performance. Which shrinks coefficients more aggressively?</p>

